@startuml DCD-03c
title DCD-03c - Diagrama de clases de diseño: motor de recomendaciones (3/3) - rankings y utilidades

' Continuación de DCD-03a/b. Cada subservicio resuelve la lista o el usuario con EntityResolver,
' excluye lo que el usuario ya tiene en 3 o más listas
' (User.getIdsExcludedFromRecommendationsOfType) y calcula los atributos dominantes con los
' rankings de dominio de ItemList / User (getTop...From..., getMain...From...), que usan
' Utils.getTopNMostRepeated. Se dibuja SongRecommendationServiceImpl como ejemplo: Genre-,
' InstrumentGenre- y LessonRecommendationServiceImpl tienen las mismas dependencias.
' Fuentes: service/recommendation/*ServiceImpl.java, utils/RecommendationConstants.java,
'          utils/EntityResolver.java, utils/Utils.java, model/ItemList.java, model/User.java
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor<<Service>> #E6F5E6
    BorderColor<<Service>> #3C8A3C
    BackgroundColor<<entity>> #FFF4E0
    BorderColor<<entity>> #B07A1F
    BackgroundColor<<Component>> #F3F3F3
}
hide empty members

class "SongRecommendationServiceImpl\n(y Genre-, InstrumentGenre-,\nLessonRecommendationServiceImpl)" as XImpl <<Service>> <<ver DCD-03b>>

package "model" {
    class ItemList <<entity>> {
        + getOnlyGenre() : Optional<Genre>
        + getMainGenreFromItems() : Optional<Genre>
        + getMainInstrumentFromItems() : Optional<Instrument>
        + getTopGenresFromItems(topN : int) : List<Genre>
        + getTopInstrumentsFromItems(topN : int) : List<Instrument>
        {method} ...
    }
    class User <<entity>> {
        + getTopGenresFromItemLists(topN : int) : List<Genre>
        + getTopInstrumentsFromItemLists(topN : int) : List<Instrument>
        + getIdsExcludedFromRecommendationsOfType(type : Class<T>) : Set<Long>
        {method} ...
    }
}

package "utils" {
    class EntityResolver <<Component>> {
        + {static} resolveItemList(id : Long) : ItemList
        + {static} resolveUser(id : Long) : User
    }
    class Utils {
        + {static} getTopNMostRepeated(items : List<T>, n : int) : List<T>
        + {static} idsToExclude(ids : Collection<Long>) : Collection<Long>
        + {static} resolvePageable(limit : Integer) : Pageable
    }
    class RecommendationConstants <<final>> {
        + {static} N_ITEM_LISTS_TO_EXCLUDE_FROM_RECOMMENDATIONS : int = 3
        + {static} N_RECOMMENDED_SONGS : int = 10
        + {static} N_RECOMMENDED_GENRES : int = 1
        + {static} N_RECOMMENDED_INSTRUMENT_GENRES : int = 3
        + {static} N_RECOMMENDED_LESSONS : int = 6
        + {static} N_HOME_RECOMMENDED_SONGS : int = 6
        + {static} N_HOME_RECOMMENDED_GENRES : int = 1
        + {static} N_HOME_RECOMMENDED_INSTRUMENT_GENRES : int = 2
        + {static} N_HOME_RECOMMENDED_LESSONS : int = 3
        + {static} N_SPOTIFY_RECOMMENDED_SONGS : int = 6
        + {static} N_SPOTIFY_RECOMMENDED_LESSONS : int = 3
        + {static} N_SPOTIFY_RECOMMENDED_INSTRUMENT_GENRES : int = 2
        + {static} N_SPOTIFY_RECOMMENDED_GENRES : int = 1
        {field} ...
    }
    note bottom of RecommendationConstants
        Nomenclatura (N = número de):
        N_[CONTEXTO_]RECOMMENDED_<ITEMS>:
          cuántos devuelve una recomendación.
        N_<ITEMS>_USED_IN_[CONTEXTO_]<TIPO>_RECOMMENDATION:
          cuántos usa un algoritmo.
        DEFAULT_N_... / MAX_N_...: valor por defecto y máximo de un parámetro.
        Las N_SPOTIFY_* las usa SpotifyRecommendationServiceImpl (DCD-04).
    end note
}

XImpl ..> EntityResolver : <<use>>
XImpl ..> RecommendationConstants
XImpl ..> Utils
XImpl ..> ItemList : rankings
XImpl ..> User : rankings
ItemList ..> Utils : getTopNMostRepeated
User ..> Utils : getTopNMostRepeated
User ..> RecommendationConstants : N_ITEM_LISTS_TO_EXCLUDE...

@enduml
